Subject: Notes on the engine
Importance: high
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=us-ascii
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit

Charles,

I have finished the notes on the engine. Note G has the table for the
Bernoulli numbers.

Ada

